# Arguments passed to every K3s server, one per line.
#
# Three etcd members share one laptop's CPU and disk. These settings stop a slow moment from
# being mistaken for a dead node. None of them belongs on real, separate machines.
--etcd-arg=heartbeat-interval=500
--etcd-arg=election-timeout=5000
# Skip fsync on every etcd write: the three "disks" are the same disk anyway.
# Data still survives a node restart; only a crash of the host itself could lose it.
--etcd-arg=unsafe-no-fsync=true
--etcd-disable-snapshots
# Not used by anything here; one less component to run.
--disable=metrics-server
